            "pk": "17889883137117856",
            "text": "🚀 Women Founders of Central Asia Shine at Invest Day!\n\nAstana Hub, in collaboration with IT Park Uzbekistan and the High-Tech Park of Kyrgyzstan, hosted an exciting invest day for women-led startups.\n\n👉 16 top projects from Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, and Uzbekistan showcased their ideas to leading investors, including Big Sky Capital VC.\n🌟 Innovations ranged from cybersecurity and fintech to FemTech, GreenTech, and more.\n\nThis event marked a big step forward for women in tech, empowering them to attract investments and shape the region’s future."
